# Transfer to Combat Sports

Each exercise receives sport-specific transfer scores.

Examples:

Boxing.

Kickboxing.

Muay Thai.

Savate.

Wrestling.

Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu.

Judo.

Sambo.

Mixed Martial Arts.

Krav Maga.

Transfer depends upon:

Movement Similarity.

Velocity Similarity.

Force Similarity.

Coordination Similarity.

Energy System Similarity.

Decision Similarity.

Environmental Similarity.

Transfer is never assumed.

It is justified.

